            "title": "Ingredients",
            "use_variant_metafield": false,
            "variant_metafield": "scent",
            "richtext": "<p>Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Maranta Arundinacea (Arrowroot) Root Extract, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Myrica Pubescens (Laurel) Fruit Wax, Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Seed Butter, Triethyl Citrate, Bambusa Arundinacea (Bamboo) Stem Extract, Zinc Ricinoleate, Bentonite, Glyceryl Laurate, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Wax, Silica, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Wax, Citronellyl Methylcrotonate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Fragrance (Parfum), Chromium Hydroxide Green (CI 77289)</p><p><strong>Scent</strong><br/>The word <strong>“fragrance” </strong>on our label represents a sophisticated composition of <strong>essential oils, natural extracts, and clean synthetics</strong>. Each element is chosen for performance and safety — <strong>vegan, non-toxic, and always free from parabens and phthalates</strong>. Our blends follow<strong> IFRA and RIFM global standards</strong>, ensuring they meet the highest benchmarks for skin compatibility. We believe scent should enhance your experience, not compromise your health or the planet.</p><p>See for more information on our <a href=\"/pages/ingredients\" title=\"Ingredients\">ingredients page</a>.</p>"
